</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Mehmet</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><source>Cell proliferation and apoptosis. Advanced methods</source><year>2003</year><publisher-loc>Oxford</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Bios Scientific Publishers Limited</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="b12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Irimajiri</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanai</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Inouye</surname><given-names>VA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dielectric theory of &#x0201c;multi-stratified shell&#x0201d; model with its application to lymphoma cell</article-title><source>J Theor Biol</source><year>1979</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>251</fpage><lpage>69</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">573830</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Labeed</surname><given-names>FH</given-names></name><name><surname>Coley</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Assessment of multidrug resistance reversal using dielectrophoresis and flow cytometry</article-title><source>Biophys J</source><year>2003</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>2028</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12944315</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Labeed</surname><given-names>FH</given-names></name><name><surname>Coley</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differences in the biophysical properties of membrane and cytoplasm of apoptotic cells revealed using dielectrophoresis</article-title><source>Biochim Biophys Acta<